# BotFather dan: /newbot yoki mavjud bot → API token
# @BotFather → /mybots → bot → API Token
# Nusxa: server/.env yarating va quyidagi qatorni haqiqiy token bilan to‘ldiring.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456789:AAxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Ayrim muhitlarda shu nom ham qo‘llanadi (ixtiyoriy):
# BOT_TOKEN=

# Ixtiyoriy
# PORT=3847
# HOST=0.0.0.0
# REFERRAL_BONUS_AMOUNT=50
# Bugun/oy daromadini qaysi vaqt zonasi bo‘yicha hisoblash (masalan O‘zbekiston)
# APP_TIMEZONE=Asia/Tashkent
#
# Production (NODE_ENV=production + TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN): /api/auth/bootstrap o‘chiq — faqat Telegram initData.
# Brauzerda sinash uchun: ALLOW_AUTH_BOOTSTRAP=1
# FORCE o‘chirish: ALLOW_AUTH_BOOTSTRAP=0
# ALLOW_AUTH_BOOTSTRAP=1

# Vizitka: PUT /api/user/bizcard — JSON brauzer + serverda users.bizcard_json (sinxron).
#
# Chek generator: /api/receipts dan keyin matn (va rasm) shu token orqali
# foydalanuvchining telegram_id ga yuboriladi. Token bo‘lmasa yoki akkauntda
# telegram_id bo‘lmasa chek faqat bazada saqlanadi.
#
# Mini App sozlash (BotFather):
# /mybots → bot → Bot Settings → Menu Button → Configure menu button
# yoki Web App URL: HTTPS manzilingiz (masalan https://sizning-domen.uz)
#
# Netlify (faqat frontend): backend alohida joyda bo'lsa, Netlify → Environment variables:
# TY_BACKEND_URL=https://SIZING-EXPRESS.onrender.com

# --- Ishlab chiqarish (production) ---
# NODE_ENV=production  bo‘lsa TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN majburiy (server ishga tushmaydi).
# NODE_ENV=production

# Reverse proxy (Render, Nginx) orqali: haqiqiy mijoz IP va rate limit uchun.
# TRUST_PROXY=1

# Mini App ochiladigan ochiq HTTPS manzil (bitta). CORS ro‘yxatiga avtomatik qo‘shiladi.
# PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://sizning-domen.uz
#
# Qo‘shimcha originlar (vergul bilan), masalan alohida Netlify domeni:
# CORS_ORIGINS=https://app.netlify.app,https://web.telegram.org

# Sessiya muddati (kun). Standart 365.
# SESSION_MAX_DAYS=90

# Ma’lumotlar bazasi zaxirasi: npm run backup-db (server papkasida yoki ildizdan)
